state.description:
The operational state of the ISIS adjacency.
	Known enum values:
	1 = DOWN — adjacency is not established;
	2 = INIT — adjacency is in the process of being established;
	3 = UP — adjacency is fully established and operational.

usage.description:
The ISIS level usage of the adjacency.
	Known enum values:
	1 = LEVEL1 — adjacency operates at Level 1 only;
	2 = LEVEL2 — adjacency operates at Level 2 only;
	3 = LEVEL1-2 — adjacency operates at both Level 1 and Level 2.
	Currently only Level 1 is supported.

